# Smoke test: fly forward while turning, so the camera crosses node
# boundaries and the worldgen driver has to stream chunks in and evict them.
# Fixed 16ms steps, so this is reproducible.
0.0 key_down W
1.0 key_down LEFT
3.0 key_up LEFT
3.0 key_down RIGHT
5.0 key_up RIGHT
5.0 key_down SPACE
6.0 key_up SPACE
8.0 key_up W
8.5 quit
